            "review_title": "Review at Yen Sushi Premium",
            "review_text": "Culture62893191655\n1 contribution\n0\nI went to lunch with my colleagues at lunchtime.\nApr 2026 • Friends\nThat afternoon I went to eat with some brothers and sisters in the company, we chose a set lunch because we needed to eat fast to get back to work, the dish was quite fast, the portion was sufficient, the taste was easy to eat, not too bitter, eating was still mild and awake, suitable for lunch during the work day.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten April 9, 2026",
